nges resistances cap: ","source_tag":"_t","target":"抗性上限改变："},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5b1112559561bf456b23af7e89a44dd4feed0e8ac0c967a016ddaa3f2acffdb6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4ccf26396b8abc709a4eead20402f4d1ce0c189321cf909cca816b04f3f95f45","logical_entry_identity":"cbca03eb6838b08ebe3f2305fe4c17e7008186911c6c6d575633df5527ac899c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Allows you to wield a physical melee or ranged weapon, a mindstar or a gem telekinetically, gaining a special effect for each.\n\t\tA gem will provide a +3 bonus to all primary stats per tier of the gem.\n\t\tA mindstar will randomly try to telekinetically grab a far away foe (10% chance and range 3 for a tier 1 mindstar, +1 range and +5% chance for each tier above 1) and pull it into melee range.\n\t\tA physical melee weapon will act as a semi independant entity, automatically attacking adjacent foes each turn, while a ranged weapon will fire at your target whenever you perform a ranged attack.\n\t\tWhile this talent is active, all melee and ranged attacks use 60% of your Cunning and Willpower in place of Dexterity and Strength for accuracy and damage calculations respectively.\n\t\t\n\n\t\t","source_tag":"_t","target":"允许你用念力装备一件物理近战或远程武器、灵晶或宝石，不同物品会获得不同效果。\n\t\t宝石：每一级材质等级使所有主要属性增加 3 点。\n\t\t灵晶：一级材质时有 10% 几率抓取 3 格内的远处敌人；材质等级每提高一级，范围增加 1 格、几率增加 5%，并将其拉入近战范围。\n\t\t物理近战武器：作为半独立实体，每回合自动攻击相邻敌人；远程武器：每当你发动远程攻击时，自动射击你的目标。\n\t\t激活时，所有近战和远程攻击在计算命中与伤害时，分别以 60% 灵巧替代敏捷、以 60% 意志替代力量。\n\n\n\t\t"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"67760f7949c490a0c374acf697f2e8b2110436a188f7d0c99d892724a50aa6bf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4cd1c260efeb632d2651b0aea52ceb6e7cb0aba6c871577c2ebcc45a3b644308","logical_entry_identity":"fd8438d9c4ff41770778aeb7d1a348c44a8e3aece1af47bb19813faed71cba01","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Thanks, my lady, that is all of them. I will look for the tunnel and venture inside the Peak.","source_tag":"_t","target":"谢谢你，我的女士，看来我已经集齐了所